                   │ MultiAgentOrchestrator      │","                     │ withTaskGroup Tool Executor │","                     └──────────────┬──────────────┘","                                    │","               ┌────────────────────┴────────────────────┐","               ▼                                         ▼","      DataFrame Query Tool                      Statistical Model Tool"],"type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Parallel-Tool-Calling","type":"heading","text":"Parallel Tool Calling"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When an agent requests multiple tool executions in a single reasoning step (e.g. computing standard deviations across three columns concurrently), ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MultiAgentOrchestrator.executeToolsInParallel(_:)"},{"text":" executes them simultaneously across available CPU cores using ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withTaskGroup"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This reduces total latency from $\\sum_{i=1}^M T_i$ to $\\max_{i} T_i$.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Example-Usage","type":"heading","text":"Example Usage"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiftAgent","import SwiftDataFrame","","\/\/ 1. Initialize orchestrator and message bus","let orchestrator = MultiAgentOrchestrator(maxRounds: 5)","","\/\/ 2. Register specialized agents","orchestrator.registerAgent(PlannerAgent())","orchestrator.registerAgent(DataAnalystAgent())","orchestrator.registerAgent(CriticAgent())","","\/\/ 3. Register tools","orchestrator.registerTool(DataFrameAgentTool(dataframe: salesData))","","\/\/ 4. Run collaborative execution","let solution = try await orchestrator.run(","    taskPrompt: \"Identify top 3 departments by salary variance and critique findings.\"",")","print(\"Consensus Answer: \\(solution)\")"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://SwiftAgent/documentation/SwiftAgent/AgentMessageBus":{"url":"\/documentation\/